   "title": "Eye trauma: is the globe OPEN?",
   "lines": [
    "look for: PEAKED pupil · Seidel sign · 360° subconjunctival hemorrhage · dark tissue at the limbus (extruded uvea) · shallow chamber",
    "also: orbital rim pain or step-off · air under the skin · lid lacerations · forehead and cheek sensation · eye movements · proptosis or sunken eye"
   ]
